---

# CORE content-type system & inbound Message envelope

## 0. Repo layout & the key finding up front

Monorepo (Bun workspaces + Turbo). Core is `packages/core` (`@spectrum-ts/core` v12.4.0), re-exported wholesale by the `spectrum-ts` metapackage (`/Users/ryanzhu/Projects/spectrum-ts/packages/spectrum-ts/src/index.ts` is literally `export * from "@spectrum-ts/core";`).

**Critical finding for your design:** `read` today is **outbound-only**. There is no inbound read-receipt anywhere in the repo — `grep -rn "readReceipt|read_receipt|readAt"` over `packages/` and `docs/` returns zero hits. `read` is in `FIRE_AND_FORGET_TYPES`, is *not* in `mapContent`'s webhook switch, and has no docs page. So an inbound read receipt is genuinely new surface area on all three axes (content, webhook, docs).

