How a dev writes a handler today (`/Users/ryanzhu/Projects/spectrum-ts/README.md:48-52`, identical in `examples/basic/index.ts:9`):
```typescript
for await (const [space, message] of app.messages) {
  await space.responding(async () => {
    await message.reply("Hello from Spectrum.");
