```

Second public entry point: `app.webhook(request, handler)` where `handler: (space, message) => …` — same `(space, message)` pair, request-scoped, does **not** feed `app.messages` (`packages/core/src/spectrum.ts:96-120`, and `docs/webhooks.mdx.vel:212`).

Content is discriminated by a plain `switch (message.content.type)` — see `docs/messages.mdx.vel:41-82` for the canonical consumer snippet.

