    unsend,
    sender: senderWithPlatform,
    space,
    timestamp: params.timestamp,
  } as Message;
  self = message;
  return message;
```
Sugar is **unconditional** — inbound and outbound messages both get `react/read/reply/edit/unsend`; the direction guards live inside each closure. `message.read()` (`build.ts:1029-1040`):
```ts
