## 2. Data flow

```
photon message-event stream (already subscribed)
  └─ message.read { actor?, chatGuid, isFromMe, occurredAt, sequence, messageGuid, readAt }
       └─ stream.ts toMessageItem                    [NEW branch]
            ├─ gate: !includeReadReceipts            -> { values: [] }, cursor advances
            ├─ gate: isActorCurrentAccount(actor)    -> { values: [] }, cursor advances
            └─ read-receipts.ts toReadReceiptMessages [NEW module]
                 ├─ drop if !actor.address
                 ├─ inbound.ts resolveTargetMessage   [EXTRACTED, shared with reactions]
                 │     cache.get -> messages.get -> rebuildFromAppleMessage -> cacheMessage
                 └─ drop unless target.direction === "outbound"
                 └─ IMessageMessage { content: read(target), sender: reader, timestamp: readAt }
                      └─ core wrapProviderMessage(raw, ctx, "inbound")
                           └─ wrapNestedContent read arm  [NEW]
                                └─ wrapProviderMessage(target, ctx, "outbound")
                                     └─ app.messages -> [space, message]
```

