2. Suppresses a receipt whose actor is the line's own address; `messages.get` never called.
3. Advances the cursor past a suppressed receipt — push read(seq 1) then inbound(seq 2), assert the inbound message still lands (same shape as the existing skip test at `:243-307`).
4. Group and poll subscriptions unchanged (reuses `startAndClose`, guards the `:136-154` expectations).

**`packages/imessage/test/remote/reactions.test.ts`** (extend). The five existing tests are the regression suite for the extraction and **must pass unmodified** — if any needs editing, the refactor changed behavior. Add: drops the reaction when the target fetch fails.

**`packages/core/test/core/receive-read.test.ts`** (new). Copies the `makeInboundProvider`/`firstMessage` scaffolding from `test/core/receive-membership.test.ts:17-45`.

